#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9441 expect=noViolation domain=TT
#note "DISCRIMINATOR (R-5.26): the TTENRL column EXISTS (blank on every row), so the not var_exists(\"TTENRL\") leaf is false and the sister stays silent - this dataset is CDISC-SEND-0378-A's state (TTDUR absent, TTENRL to populate), and that sibling reports the blank rows at their locations. The sister answers only for the neither-column state."
#library standard=sendig-dart version=1-2
dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col TTENRL  type=Char label="Repro Stage End Rule"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating |
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation |
